{"text":"景明三年八月十八日，廣川王祖母太妃侯爲亡夫侍中、使持節、征北大將軍、廣川王賀蘭汗造彌勒像。願令永絶苦因，速成正覺。","tags":[{"name":"PersonName","term":"太妃","refId":null,"text":"太妃","start":15,"end":17},{"name":"Office","term":"侍中","refId":null,"text":"侍中","start":21,"end":23},{"name":"Office","term":"使持節","refId":null,"text":"使持節","start":24,"end":27},{"name":"Office","term":"征北大將軍","refId":null,"text":"征北大將軍","start":28,"end":33},{"name":"PersonName","term":"賀蘭汗","refId":null,"text":"賀蘭汗","start":37,"end":40},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"彌勒","refId":null,"text":"彌勒","start":41,"end":43},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"正覺","refId":null,"text":"正覺","start":54,"end":56}]}